"""Reproducible bilingual PAEA v0.3 F-12 finance demonstrator.

Outputs FR+EN DOCX, editable Mermaid sources and rendered color diagrams.
Requires python-docx, Graphviz `dot`; Mermaid CLI `mmdc` optional.
Usage: python PAEA_F12_Guide_Finance_build.py --out ./output
Alternatively use --reuse-diagrams-from ./docs/PAEA to preserve embedded pictures
without Graphviz. The adjacent PAEA_F12_editorial.json supplies reviewed FR/EN prose.
No external banking or model API calls are made.
"""
